{"id":"mahabharata-9-013","work":"mahabharata","part":9,"partName":"शल्यपर्व","partNameEn":"Shalya Parva","unit":13,"title":"त्रयोदशोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 13 · Arjuna against Ashvatthaman","summary":{"en":"Arjuna, struck by Drona's son with many iron arrows, fights back, and the battlefield fills with parasols and crowns scattered. Ashvatthaman hurls a club at Arjuna, who cuts it down, and the fighting is like that of Indra in the old days.","kn":"ಅಶ್ವತ್ಥಾಮ ಅನೇಕ ಕಬ್ಬಿಣದ ಬಾಣಗಳಿಂದ ಅರ್ಜುನನನ್ನು ಹೊಡೆಯುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಅರ್ಜುನ ಪ್ರತಿಹೋರಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ, ರಣರಂಗ ಛತ್ರ, ಕಿರೀಟಗಳಿಂದ ತುಂಬುತ್ತದೆ. ಅಶ್ವತ್ಥಾಮ ಎಸೆದ ಪರಿಘವನ್ನು ಅರ್ಜುನ ಕಡಿಯುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಇಂದ್ರನ ಹಿಂದಿನ ಯುದ್ಧದಂತೆ ಹೋರಾಟ ನಡೆಯುತ್ತದೆ.","hi":"अश्वत्थामा बहुत से लोहे के बाणों से अर्जुन को बींधता है और अर्जुन प्रत्युत्तर देते हैं, रणभूमि छत्रों और मुकुटों से पट जाती है। अश्वत्थामा परिघ फेंकता है जिसे अर्जुन काट देते हैं, और युद्ध पुराने इन्द्र-युद्ध जैसा होता है।","te":"అశ్వత్థామ అనేక ఇనుప బాణాలతో అర్జునుని గుచ్చుతాడు; అర్జునుడు ఎదురు పోరాడతాడు, రణభూమి గొడుగులు, కిరీటాలతో నిండుతుంది. అశ్వత్థామ విసిరిన పరిఘను అర్జునుడు నరుకుతాడు; పూర్వ ఇంద్రయుద్ధంలా పోరు సాగుతుంది.","ta":"அஸ்வத்தாமன் பல இரும்பு அம்புகளால் அர்ஜுனனைத் தாக்க, அர்ஜுனன் எதிர்த்துப் போரிட, களம் குடைகளாலும் மகுடங்களாலும் நிறைகிறது. அஸ்வத்தாமன் எறிந்த பரிகத்தை அர்ஜுனன் வெட்ட, போர் பழைய இந்திரப் போர் போல் நடக்கிறது.","ml":"ദ്രോണപുത്രൻ ഇരുമ്പമ്പുകൾകൊണ്ട് പ്രഹരിച്ചതോടെ അർജുനൻ തിരിച്ചടിക്കുന്നു; യുദ്ധക്കളം ചിതറിയ കുടകളും കിരീടങ്ങളും കൊണ്ട് നിറയുന്നു. അശ്വത്ഥാമാവ് അർജുനന്റെ നേർക്ക് ഗദ എറിയുന്നു; അർജുനൻ അതിനെ മുറിക്കുന്നു. പണ്ടത്തെ ഇന്ദ്രന്റെ യുദ്ധംപോലെയാണ് പോരാട്ടം."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 9.13; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Jun 23 2020","sections":[{"title":"शल्यपर्व","titleEn":"Shalya Parva","verses":[{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"अर्जुनो द्रौणिना विद्धो युद्धे बहुभिरायसैः ।\nतस्य चानुचरैः शूरैस्त्रिगर्तानां महारथैः ।\nद्रौणिं विव्याध समरे त्रिभिरेव शिलीमुखैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Arjuna, pierced in the battle by Drona's son with many iron arrows, and pressed by the heroic Trigarta great warriors who followed him, pierced Drona's son in turn with three arrows."}},{"n":2,"text":"तथेतरान्महेष्वासान्द्वाभ्यां द्वाभ्यां धनंजयः ।\nभूयश्चैव महाबाहुः शरवर्षैरवाकिरत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dhananjaya, the mighty-armed, also pierced the other great archers with two arrows each, and again covered them with showers of arrows."}},{"n":3,"text":"शरकण्टकितास्ते तु तावका भरतर्षभ ।\nन जहुः समरे पार्थं वध्यमानाः शितैः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bristling with arrows, your men, best of Bharatas, did not leave Arjuna in the battle, even as they were struck by his sharp arrows."}},{"n":4,"text":"तेऽर्जुनं रथवंशेन द्रोणपुत्रपुरोगमाः ।\nअयोधयन्त समरे परिवार्य महारथाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Led by Drona's son and in a mass of chariots, those great warriors surrounded Arjuna and fought him in the battle."}},{"n":5,"text":"तैस्तु क्षिप्ताः शरा राजन्कार्तस्वरविभूषिताः ।\nअर्जुनस्य रथोपस्थं पूरयामासुरञ्जसा ॥","meaning":{"en":"The arrows they shot, O king, adorned with gold, easily filled the seat of Arjuna's chariot."}},{"n":6,"text":"तथा कृष्णौ महेष्वासौ वृषभौ सर्वधन्विनाम् ।\nशरैर्वीक्ष्य वितुन्नाङ्गौ प्रहृष्टौ युद्धदुर्मदौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the two Krishnas, great archers and bulls among all bowmen, their limbs pricked by arrows, they were delighted, though the two were wild in battle."}},{"n":7,"text":"कूबरं रथचक्राणि ईषा योक्त्राणि चाभिभो ।\nयुगं चैवानुकर्षं च शरभूतमभूत्तदा ॥","meaning":{"en":"The chariot's yoke-seat, wheels, pole, reins, yoke and chariot floor all became, mighty one, a thing of arrows."}},{"n":8,"text":"नैतादृशं दृष्टपूर्वं राजन्नैव च नः श्रुतम् ।\nयादृशं तत्र पार्थस्य तावकाः संप्रचक्रिरे ॥","meaning":{"en":"We have never seen or heard, O king, anything like what your men did to Arjuna there."}},{"n":9,"text":"स रथः सर्वतो भाति चित्रपुङ्खैः शितैः शरैः ।\nउल्काशतैः संप्रदीप्तं विमानमिव भूतले ॥","meaning":{"en":"That chariot shone all round, stuck with sharp arrows with bright feathers, like a heavenly car on earth blazing with hundreds of meteors."}},{"n":10,"text":"ततोऽर्जुनो महाराज शरैः संनतपर्वभिः ।\nअवाकिरत्तां पृतनां मेघो वृष्ट्या यथाचलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, great king, Arjuna covered that army with arrows with bent joints, as a cloud covers a mountain with rain."}},{"n":11,"text":"ते वध्यमानाः समरे पार्थनामाङ्कितैः शरैः ।\nपार्थभूतममन्यन्त प्रेक्षमाणास्तथाविधम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Struck in the battle by arrows marked with Partha's name, they saw everyone as Partha, looking at things so."}},{"n":12,"text":"ततोऽद्भुतशरज्वालो धनुःशब्दानिलो महान् ।\nसेनेन्धनं ददाहाशु तावकं पार्थपावकः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the fire that was Partha, with arrows for wondrous flame and the sound of his bow for a great wind, quickly burned your army, which was its fuel."}},{"n":13,"text":"चक्राणां पततां चैव युगानां च धरातले ।\nतूणीराणां पताकानां ध्वजानां च रथैः सह ॥","meaning":{"en":"Fallen wheels and yokes on the ground, quivers, flags and banners with their chariots,"}},{"n":14,"text":"ईषाणामनुकर्षाणां त्रिवेणूनां च भारत ।\nअक्षाणामथ योक्त्राणां प्रतोदानां च सर्वशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"poles, floor-boards, triple-staffed frames, axles, reins and whips, all over, Bharata,"}},{"n":15,"text":"शिरसां पततां चैव कुण्डलोष्णीषधारिणाम् ।\nभुजानां च महाराज स्कन्धानां च समन्ततः ॥","meaning":{"en":"fallen heads with earrings and turbans, arms and shoulders on all sides, great king,"}},{"n":16,"text":"छत्राणां व्यजनैः सार्धं मुकुटानां च राशयः ।\nसमदृश्यन्त पार्थस्य रथमार्गेषु भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"parasols with fans, and heaps of crowns, were seen along the paths of Partha's chariot, Bharata."}},{"n":17,"text":"अगम्यरूपा पृथिवी मांसशोणितकर्दमा ।\nबभूव भरतश्रेष्ठ रुद्रस्याक्रीडनं यथा ।\nभीरूणां त्रासजननी शूराणां हर्षवर्धनी ॥","meaning":{"en":"The earth became impassable, a mud of flesh and blood, best of Bharatas, like the playground of Rudra, making cowards tremble and cheering the brave."}},{"n":18,"text":"हत्वा तु समरे पार्थः सहस्रे द्वे परंतप ।\nरथानां सवरूथानां विधूमोऽग्निरिव ज्वलन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having killed two thousand covered chariots in the battle, scorcher of foes, Partha blazed like a smokeless fire."}},{"n":19,"text":"यथा हि भगवानग्निर्जगद्दग्ध्वा चराचरम् ।\nविधूमो दृश्यते राजंस्तथा पार्थो महारथः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Just as the blessed fire is seen smokeless after burning the whole world of moving and unmoving things, king, so the great warrior Partha was seen."}},{"n":20,"text":"द्रौणिस्तु समरे दृष्ट्वा पाण्डवस्य पराक्रमम् ।\nरथेनातिपताकेन पाण्डवं प्रत्यवारयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the Pandava's prowess in the battle, Drona's son checked the Pandava with a chariot bearing many banners."}},{"n":21,"text":"तावुभौ पुरुषव्याघ्रौ श्वेताश्वौ धन्विनां वरौ ।\nसमीयतुस्तदा तूर्णं परस्परवधैषिणौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those two tigers among men, both with white horses, the finest of archers, then swiftly met, each wanting to kill the other."}},{"n":22,"text":"तयोरासीन्महाराज बाणवर्षं सुदारुणम् ।\nजीमूतानां यथा वृष्टिस्तपान्ते भरतर्षभ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Between them, great king, there came a terrible shower of arrows, like the rain of clouds at the end of summer, best of Bharatas."}},{"n":23,"text":"अन्योन्यस्पर्धिनौ तौ तु शरैः संनतपर्वभिः ।\nततक्षतुर्मृधेऽन्योन्यं शृङ्गाभ्यां वृषभाविव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Rivals of each other, they tore at each other in the fight with arrows with bent joints, like two bulls with their horns."}},{"n":24,"text":"तयोर्युद्धं महाराज चिरं सममिवाभवत् ।\nअस्त्राणां संगमश्चैव घोरस्तत्राभवन्महान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Their fight, great king, long seemed equal, and a great and fearful meeting of divine weapons took place there."}},{"n":25,"text":"ततोऽर्जुनं द्वादशभी रुक्मपुङ्खैः सुतेजनैः ।\nवासुदेवं च दशभिर्द्रौणिर्विव्याध भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Drona's son pierced Arjuna with twelve well-whetted, gold-feathered arrows and Vasudeva with ten, Bharata."}},{"n":26,"text":"ततः प्रहस्य बीभत्सुर्व्याक्षिपद्गाण्डिवं धनुः ।\nमानयित्वा मुहूर्तं च गुरुपुत्रं महाहवे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Bibhatsu laughed and drew his Gandiva bow; having honored his teacher's son for a moment in that great battle,"}},{"n":27,"text":"व्यश्वसूतरथं चक्रे सव्यसाची महारथः ।\nमृदुपूर्वं ततश्चैनं त्रिभिर्विव्याध सायकैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"the great warrior, Savyasachin, made him horseless, charioteerless and chariotless, and then gently pierced him with three arrows."}},{"n":28,"text":"हताश्वे तु रथे तिष्ठन्द्रोणपुत्रस्त्वयस्मयम् ।\nमुसलं पाण्डुपुत्राय चिक्षेप परिघोपमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Standing on a chariot whose horses were dead, Drona's son hurled at the son of Pandu an iron club like a bar."}},{"n":29,"text":"तमापतन्तं सहसा हेमपट्टविभूषितम् ।\nचिच्छेद सप्तधा वीरः पार्थः शत्रुनिबर्हणः ॥","meaning":{"en":"As it flew suddenly, adorned with gold bands, the hero Partha, slayer of foes, cut it into seven pieces."}},{"n":30,"text":"स च्छिन्नं मुसलं दृष्ट्वा द्रौणिः परमकोपनः ।\nआददे परिघं घोरं नगेन्द्रशिखरोपमम् ।\nचिक्षेप चैव पार्थाय द्रौणिर्युद्धविशारदः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing his club cut, Drona's son, extremely angry, took up a dreadful iron bar like a mountain king's peak, and, skilled in battle, hurled it at Partha."}},{"n":31,"text":"तमन्तकमिव क्रुद्धं परिघं प्रेक्ष्य पाण्डवः ।\nअर्जुनस्त्वरितो जघ्ने पञ्चभिः सायकोत्तमैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing that bar come like angry Death, the Pandava Arjuna quickly struck it with five of his best arrows."}},{"n":32,"text":"स च्छिन्नः पतितो भूमौ पार्थबाणैर्महाहवे ।\nदारयन्पृथिवीन्द्राणां मनः शब्देन भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Cut by Partha's arrows in the great battle, it fell to the ground, splitting the hearts of kings with its crash, Bharata."}},{"n":33,"text":"ततोऽपरैस्त्रिभिर्बाणैर्द्रौणिं विव्याध पाण्डवः ।\nसोऽतिविद्धो बलवता पार्थेन सुमहाबलः ।\nन संभ्रान्तस्तदा द्रौणिः पौरुषे स्वे व्यवस्थितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the Pandava pierced Drona's son with three more arrows; though deeply pierced by strong Partha, mighty Drona's son was not unnerved and held to his manliness."}},{"n":34,"text":"सुधर्मा तु ततो राजन्भारद्वाजं महारथम् ।\nअवाकिरच्छरव्रातैः सर्वक्षत्रस्य पश्यतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Sudharma, O king, showered the great warrior Ashvatthama with masses of arrows, as all the warrior class watched."}},{"n":35,"text":"ततस्तु सुरथोऽप्याजौ पाञ्चालानां महारथः ।\nरथेन मेघघोषेण द्रौणिमेवाभ्यधावत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Suratha, a great warrior of the Panchalas, also charged Drona's son in the battle in a chariot rumbling like thunderclouds."}},{"n":36,"text":"विकर्षन्वै धनुः श्रेष्ठं सर्वभारसहं दृढम् ।\nज्वलनाशीविषनिभैः शरैश्चैनमवाकिरत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Drawing his fine, strong bow that bore every burden, he covered him with arrows like blazing venomous snakes."}},{"n":37,"text":"सुरथं तु ततः क्रुद्धमापतन्तं महारथम् ।\nचुकोप समरे द्रौणिर्दण्डाहत इवोरगः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Drona's son grew angry with the great warrior Suratha as he charged, like a snake struck with a stick."}},{"n":38,"text":"त्रिशिखां भ्रुकुटीं कृत्वा सृक्किणी परिलेलिहन् ।\nउद्वीक्ष्य सुरथं रोषाद्धनुर्ज्यामवमृज्य च ।\nमुमोच तीक्ष्णं नाराचं यमदण्डसमद्युतिम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Making his brow a triple furrow, licking the corners of his mouth, looking at Suratha in rage and wiping his bowstring, he loosed a sharp iron arrow shining like Yama's rod."}},{"n":39,"text":"स तस्य हृदयं भित्त्वा प्रविवेशातिवेगतः ।\nशक्राशनिरिवोत्सृष्टा विदार्य धरणीतलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"It pierced his heart and went in with great speed, like Indra's thunderbolt hurled and splitting the ground."}},{"n":40,"text":"ततस्तं पतितं भूमौ नाराचेन समाहतम् ।\nवज्रेणेव यथा शृङ्गं पर्वतस्य महाधनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then he lay on the ground, struck by the iron arrow, like a splendid mountain peak struck by a thunderbolt."}},{"n":41,"text":"तस्मिंस्तु निहते वीरे द्रोणपुत्रः प्रतापवान् ।\nआरुरोह रथं तूर्णं तमेव रथिनां वरः ॥","meaning":{"en":"When that hero was killed, mighty Drona's son, best of chariot-fighters, quickly climbed onto his chariot."}},{"n":42,"text":"ततः सज्जो महाराज द्रौणिराहवदुर्मदः ।\nअर्जुनं योधयामास संशप्तकवृतो रणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, ready, great king, wild in battle, Drona's son fought Arjuna, surrounded by the Samshaptakas in the fight."}},{"n":43,"text":"तत्र युद्धं महच्चासीदर्जुनस्य परैः सह ।\nमध्यंदिनगते सूर्ये यमराष्ट्रविवर्धनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"There was a great fight between Arjuna and the enemy, swelling Yama's kingdom, when the sun was at midday."}},{"n":44,"text":"तत्राश्चर्यमपश्याम दृष्ट्वा तेषां पराक्रमम् ।\nयदेको युगपद्वीरान्समयोधयदर्जुनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There we saw a wonder as we watched their prowess: Arjuna alone fought the heroes all at once."}},{"n":45,"text":"विमर्दस्तु महानासीदर्जुनस्य परैः सह ।\nशतक्रतोर्यथा पूर्वं महत्या दैत्यसेनया ॥","meaning":{"en":"There was a great grinding battle between Arjuna and the enemy, as of old between Indra and the great army of the Daityas."}}]}]}